{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20260MFoTOkmtO1790732831.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p style=\"text-align: left;\">沙田水泉澳邨有單位起火，初步四人吸入濃煙不適，送院治理。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.ST-0730.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Lcw7mj0gts1790728549.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.FIRE.ST-0730.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">起火單位在欣泉樓，窗戶簷蓬頂被燒至熏黑。約60名居民自行疏散，有人帶同寵物龜離開。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.ST-0730_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026p3bUMlfPUp1790728544.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.FIRE.ST-0730_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方指早上近七時接報，消防到場將火救熄。涉事一家四口，包括父母及一對子女吸入濃煙不適，送到威爾斯醫院治理。現場消息指，涉事單位最先是梳化著火，消防正調查起火原因。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-30T02:19:55.924187+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}